{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_003_02_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c52450c46309346075970e448b33ea806c2df6f8860e4fcd89cd8ddee04f7f52",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7208b193f5db25f97454dfaadd7921692dab68442c711c7df381d4ff0767eff5",
      "text": "伊集院北斗的特别日子",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e6e29ab82c2ae262ff3810ee624307ba62e6ac178dd5e50dd2f069b6a44988f",
      "text": "冬马和翔太在准备为北斗庆祝生日。\n但生日当天是情人节，\n两人怀疑北斗是否有空。\n另一方面，北斗却称生日已有约，\n回绝了女性的约会邀请……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7208b193f5db25f97454dfaadd7921692dab68442c711c7df381d4ff0767eff5",
      "text": "伊集院北斗的特别日子",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d32e1237a22444788605e0927c5d6726ce47e18e1fb726736dbd59601eb480b",
      "text": "啊！冬马君在看好时髦的食谱书。\n什么时候做呀？也要给我准备一份哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a28b31226984219a025d08f244c9c23232cc882848768170ae640ec592157965",
      "text": "哦。……马上就是北斗的生日了嘛，\n想稍微下点血本。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:500ffc521113fe58b1e764f525d537785e2fa649260d65b94fc56faa43b876a7",
      "text": "哇～！那也做这个嘛，还有这个、这个！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a58453dedb57097225e1f06f9c33fbc9b91458d19c8a16333beb6185ac194cd",
      "text": "又不是你过生日……\n嘛，做做倒也无所谓啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be0b156605941480412456547b7cad5b8a6e55f36e75c2f83b67d2f794f7a240",
      "text": "放心啦～我会好好挑\n北斗君会喜欢的东西的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2878e93d76dbfced7d3191b8946beda77cc2ec5f8ba9df17f48a8e38666d36e3",
      "text": "说起来，有问过最重要的北斗君的日程吗？\n北斗君的生日可是2月14日哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aaa75da3cdd5274eb0a8fe6083f4f238a1dab6468fdb1b59cbecc738642a7ba5",
      "text": "糟……糟糕！\n本来想给他发LINK的结果给忘了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dc68a5e26e15f235790e77b92a303127708e10b2cff448886eb2d21e650eb3d",
      "text": "既是生日又是情人节，\n说不定早就被约满了吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9337c3859066149a214b953457cf4f9b5492a1a22b09c945c0c8af404dae2ae7",
      "text": "啊哈哈，也是呢。按北斗君的性子，\n早中晚大概都被约会排满了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_02_1_2_003_02:1_2_003_02_a:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c53bc232d7cea6a00527434d015cf77a22a2ff1c94f4606d2e83e43e8867aae6",
      "text": "很有可能啊……算了，总之先问问看\n能不能抽空挤出点时间吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
